cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.105</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ τῶν χρημάτων κ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">331b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">διὰ τὴν τῶν υἱέων κ.</span> on account of <b class=\"lex-tr\">your having</b> sons, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἱματίων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">64d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φέροντας.. ἀγαθοῦ κτῆσιν οὐδενός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.308</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κ. ἐκ δεσπότου καὶ δούλου [συνέστηκεν</span>] <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pol.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1277a8</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">holding</b>, opp. <span class=\"gk\">χρῆσις</span> ('using'), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EN</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1098b32</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">ownership</b>, opp. <span class=\"gk\">χρῆσις</span> ('usufruct'), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">POxy.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">237 viii 35</span> </span>, al.; <span class=\"gk\">τὰς κτήσεις βεβαίας εἶμεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">42(1).76.25</span> </span> (Epid., <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii B.C.</span>). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> as collective, = κτήματα, <b clas